        17.55562888071897,
        17.434861742424346
      ],
      "text": "b.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.26602810457516,
        23.197341856060575,
        817.7736430555557,
        17.434861742424346
      ],
      "text": "That the proposed easement is the most convenient and the least onerous to the servient estate.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        68.56957512626263,
        941.418282638889,
        17.434861742424346
      ],
      "text": "Easements relating to the appropriation and use of waters may be modiaed by agreement of the contracting",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        95.34672948232321,
        664.8147470996732,
        17.434861742424346
      ],
      "text": "parties provided the same is not contrary to law or prejudicial to third persons.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        140.71911805555567,
        941.4048002042483,
        17.434861742424232
      ],
      "text": "ARTICLE 26. Where water shortage is recurrent, the use of the water pursuant to a permit may, in the interest",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        167.49619476010116,
        882.2606923611111,
        17.43486174242412
      ],
      "text": "of equitable distribution of beneats among legal appropriators, be reduced after due notice and hearing.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        212.8685056818183,
        937.7549962826798,
        17.43486174242412
      ],
      "text": "ARTICLE 27. Water users shall bear the diminution of any water supply due to natural causes or force majeure.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        258.24081660353545,
        941.3952871323529,
        17.434861742424232
      ],
      "text": "ARTICLE 28. Water permits shall continue to be valid as long as water is beneacially used; however, it may be",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        285.0180486111111,
        941.4088868055557,
        17.434861742424232
      ],
      "text": "suspended on the grounds of non-compliance with approved plans and speciacations or schedules of water",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        311.7951123737374,
        941.3970289624183,
        17.434861742424346
      ],
      "text": "distribution; use of water for a purpose other than that for which it was granted; non-payment of water",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        338.5721890782829,
        941.4071449754904,
        17.43486174242412
      ],
      "text": "charges; wastage; failure to keep records of water diversion, when required; and violation of any term or",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        365.3492528409091,
        670.0280612336602,
        17.434900568181888
      ],
      "text": "condition of any permit or of rules and regulations promulgated by the Council.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        410.7216931818182,
        941.4244292892158,
        17.434887626262594
      ],
      "text": "Temporary permits may be issued for the appropriation and use of water for short periods under special",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        437.49879577020204,
        131.2626707107843,
        17.434900568181774
      ],
      "text": "circumstances.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        482.87106786616164,
        941.4168590277778,
        17.434900568181774
      ],
      "text": "ARTICLE 29. Water permits may be revoked after due notice and hearing on grounds of non-use; gross",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        509.6481833964647,
        941.3897601715687,
        17.43490056818183
      ],
      "text": "violation of the conditions imposed in the permit; unauthorized sale of water; willful failure or refusal to",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        536.425247159091,
        941.3951866421569,
        17.43490056818183
      ],
      "text": "comply with rules and regulations or any lawful order; pollution, public nuisance or acts detrimental to public",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        563.2024791666668,
        941.4032593545752,
        17.43490056818183
      ],
      "text": "health and safety; when the appropriator is found to be disqualiaed under the law to exploit and develop",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        589.9795558712121,
        941.4180816584969,
        17.43490056818183
      ],
      "text": "natural resources of the Philippines; when, in the case of irrigation, the land is converted to non-agricultural",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        616.756658459596,
        312.4946625408497,
        17.43490056818183
      ],
      "text": "purposes; and other similar grounds.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        662.1289693813131,
        941.4342270833334,
        17.43490056818183
      ],
      "text": "ARTICLE 30. All water permits are subject to modiacation or cancellation by the Council, after due notice and",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        688.9060460858586,
        941.4123537173205,
        17.434874684343413
      ],
      "text": "hearing, in favor of a project of greater beneacial use or for multi-purpose development, and a water permittee",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        715.683252209596,
        941.3973304330066,
        17.434874684343413
      ],
      "text": "who suffers thereby shall be duly compensated by the entity or person in whose favor the cancellation was",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        742.4603418560606,
        53.451859109477134,
        17.43488762626265
      ],
      "text": "made.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        457.60187091503263,
        787.8326527777779,
        109.77217401960792,
        17.434887626262594
      ],
      "text": "CHAPTER IV",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/CQVXGY+Roboto-Bold",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        424.5132965686274,
        833.2049507575757,
        175.95702696078433,
        17.43487468434344
      ],
      "text": "Utilization of Waters",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/CQVXGY+Roboto-Bold",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        878.5772487373738,
        941.4050011846406,
        17.43488115530303
      ],
      "text": "ARTICLE 31. Preference in the development of water resources shall consider security of the State, multiple",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        905.3544289772727,
        558.6984399101308,
        17.4348798611111
      ],
      "text": "use, beneacial effects, adverse effects and costs of development.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        950.7267360164142,
        941.4110305964053,
        17.434885037878786
      ],
      "text": "ARTICLE 32. The utilization of subterranean or ground water shall be coordinated with that of surface waters",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        977.5038916666666,
        941.4005963643792,
        17.434883743686868
      ],
      "text": "such as rivers, streams, springs and lakes, so that a superior right in one is not adversely affected by an",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
